keywords:
  - pension
  - dynamic microsimulation
  - China
  - multi-pillar pension system
  - minimum contribution period
  - retirement age reform
abstract: >-
  China PensionSIM is a rule-based monthly dynamic microsimulation model of
  China's three-pillar pension system. It encodes eligibility, contribution,
  benefit, transfer and tax rules with their legal sources, including the
  2025-2039 retirement-age reform and the rise of the minimum contribution
  period from 15 to 20 years.
